# data/ stays untracked EXCEPT the frozen red-team suite (deliberate exception,
# 2026-08-26): the suite is the evaluation instrument, is small, existed in exactly
# one place on one disk (Amendment 15 flagged this), and reproducibility requires it.
# `data/*` + `!data/redteam/` instead of `data/` because git cannot re-include files
# under an excluded directory. .gitattributes marks these files -text so committed
# bytes equal working-tree bytes and the frozen SHA-256 is platform-independent.
data/*
!data/redteam/
results/
env/
*.pt
*.safetensors
__pycache__/
